      "scene:b2": {
        "title": "The Drowned Descent",
        "summary": "Following the rope down (or by Sedge's diving-bell), the party enters the flooded upper streets of Hollowmere \u2014 a canted, silt-choked ruin threaded with air-pockets in overturned houses. Navigate the maze of streets and trapped air (Survival/Investigation DC 13 to find breathable pockets and the church's bell-arch), avoid the drowned that drift like weeds, or lure them off with light and noise. Pip may recognize a smuggler's cache here \u2014 his family fled Hollowmere before the flood, leaving debts of their own. The clapper of the great bell was stolen and hidden in a submerged countinghouse.",
        "exits": [
          "scene:b3"
        ],
